<h2>In the editor</h2>
<p>Put the frame on the last twenty seconds (as a rendered PNG, or the page itself in an HTML-first renderer), then in YouTube’s end-screen editor place a video element on each slot and the subscribe element on the circle. The slots are 15.4em × 8.65em and the circle 7.35em, so at 1920 × 1080 they are YouTube’s sizes exactly.</p>
